# Build inputs linked in beside the tree on a bundle-build box. `node_modules/`
# above matches a directory, not a symlink named node_modules, and the private
# checkout was only ever excluded in one machine's .git/info/exclude — so both
# have been staged by a `git add -A` during a rebuild. Naming them here is what
# stops that from reaching a commit.
/clankandslop-private
/website/node_modules
